OL,3,GNEWSACouncil bids to use Cornish
OL,4,Alanguage on road signs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid has been made asking for
OL,7,Fpermission to allow road signs in
OL,8,FCornwall to include both the Cornish
OL,9,Fand English versions of place names in
OL,10,Ffuture.
OL,12,FCornwall Council believes displaying
OL,13,Fboth languages on any new and
OL,14,Freplacement signs would help promote
OL,15,FCornish and create a sense of pride.
OL,17,FIt explained it did not have the power
OL,18,Fto do it currently and had written to
OL,19,Fthe Government asking for the ability
OL,20,Fto.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
