OL,3,GNEWSACouncil bids to use Cornish
OL,4,Alanguage on road signs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Transport said it
OL,7,Fwas committed to supporting the Cornish
OL,8,Flanguage but there were strict rules
OL,9,Faround the design and language allowed
OL,10,Fon road signs for safety reasons.
